### SCENARIO: Input validation catches malformed requests

### Missing required fields — expects 400
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Invalid policyType — expects 400
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "INVALID_TYPE",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "validation-001"
}

### Invalid date format — expects 400
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "not-a-date",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "validation-002"
}

### Negative days — expects 400
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": -1,
  "idempotencyKey": "validation-003"
}

### Unknown field (forbidNonWhitelisted) — expects 400
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-01",
  "endDate": "2026-05-05",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "validation-004",
  "hackerField": "malicious"
}

### Start date after end date — expects 422
# Note: passes class-validator (both valid dates) but fails business logic
POST http://localhost:3000/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": "emp-1",
  "locationId": "loc-nyc",
  "policyType": "VACATION",
  "startDate": "2026-05-10",
  "endDate": "2026-05-01",
  "days": 3,
  "idempotencyKey": "validation-005"
}
